starcloud|GENERIC||None||Data centers in space|space hardware, no ML proof point|Space data centers depend on radiating heat from high-power GPUs without convection.
vectorshift|RAG|P3|Strong|AGENT_EVAL|AI system for private market investors over data rooms and deal history|data room analysis and institutional knowledge = retrieval -> P4|Data room analysis breaks when the deciding figure sits in one scanned schedule among thousands of files.
vendease|GENERIC||None||Food supply marketplace for African restaurants|marketplace, no ML proof point|24-hour supply depends on sourcing reliability from fragmented farms and manufacturers.
maple-materials|GENERIC||None||Electrolysis process turning CO2 into battery-grade graphite|electrochemistry hardware, no ML proof point|Battery-grade graphite from CO2 depends on controlling crystal structure during electrolysis.
fountain|GENERIC||None||High volume hiring platform|HR SaaS, no matching proof point|High volume hiring depends on keeping candidates moving through steps before they drop off.
222|GENERIC||None||AI recommendations for offline social experiences|consumer marketplace, no proof point is the same problem|Recommending in-person experiences depends on matching people from very little behavioral data.
kunduz|GENERIC||None|AGENT_EVAL|Instant answers to student test prep questions|tutor marketplace, no proof point is the same problem|Instant answers at scale depend on routing each question to a tutor who can answer it correctly.
bland-ai|VOICE_EXCLUDED||None||Enterprise platform for AI phone calls|core product is voice agents|Enterprise phone agents need guardrails that hold across millions of calls.
loopfour|AGENT_EVAL||Moderate|CODE|Deterministic, auditable automation of finance workflows|finance automation where avoiding wrong outputs is the product -> P3|Finance automation earns trust only when every exception routing decision is auditable and tested against past periods.
feroot-security|GENERIC||None|CODE|Website compliance and script security for privacy and PCI rules|web security compliance, no proof point is the same problem|PCI 4 script monitoring depends on spotting unauthorized changes in third-party scripts on payment pages.
examedi|GENERIC||None||At-home lab and nurse visits in Latin America|healthcare marketplace, no ML proof point|At-home lab visits depend on routing technicians tightly enough to keep samples within handling windows.
